# Changes to these files wait for Samuel's review once branch protection requires code owners' reviews
# (tools/ci/protect_pipeline.sh, docs/security.md). They are what builds, signs and ships releases, the code that
# checks downloads before installing them (backend.rs downloads, installs and updates the launcher itself; links.json
# says where from; the Cargo.toml files pick the crates that do it), and this file. Everything else merges as soon as
# `verify` passes.
/.github/                                @glearflame
/tools/ci/                               @glearflame
/tools/release_train.py                  @glearflame
/crates/horizon-release-sign/            @glearflame
/crates/horizon-server/src/update.rs     @glearflame
/crates/horizon-server/Cargo.toml        @glearflame
/launcher/src/signed.rs                  @glearflame
/launcher/src/backend.rs                 @glearflame
/launcher/links.json                     @glearflame
/launcher/Cargo.toml                     @glearflame
/packaging/                              @glearflame
